### 5.11 User Profile & Order Tracking

**File:** `src/app/profile/page.tsx`

Matches the site's light theme (`bg-gray-50`, white cards, standard Tailwind patterns).

**Profile Header:**
- Avatar with hover camera overlay — clicking it opens a file picker (Feature B fix)
- Uploaded photo converted to base64 via `FileReader` and persisted via `updateUser()` → `ammoo-user-overrides`
- "Hover over photo to change it" hint text below avatar
- Role badge and verified/unverified indicator

**Edit Profile Form (toggle):**
- Full Name, Email Address, **Contact Number** (required), City, **Postal Code**, Street Address
- Inline save with 700ms simulated persist; changes stored via `updateUser()` to survive page reload

**Profile Details Panel:**
- Read-only view of all profile fields including new contact/postal fields

**My Orders Section:**
- Loads all orders from `seller-store.ts` filtered by `customer.email === user.email`
- Each order is a collapsible row showing ID, status badge, tracking number, date, item count, total
- **Expanded view** includes:
  - Line items with quantities, sizes, colors, and line totals
  - Order subtotal / shipping / total breakdown
  - Shipping address
  - **Status timeline** — connected dot indicator showing full history with timestamps

**Followed Shops:**
- Lists all shops the user follows with direct links

**Quick Actions:**
- Browse Products, View Cart, Wishlist — links matching site style

---

### 5.12 Admin Panel

**File:** `src/app/admin/page.tsx`

Fixed left sidebar with **7 sections**:

| Section | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| Dashboard Overview | Platform-wide stats: total users, sellers, revenue, orders |
| Seller Management | Full seller list — ban/suspend/activate accounts; view/approve/reject sensitive profile changes; payout request review |
| Post Management | Product approval queue — approve, reject (with required comment), set under review |
| Order Management | All platform orders — tracking IDs, handover proofs, admin-reviewed flag, modular notification stub |
| Customer Management | All customer accounts — profile details, order history, activity |
| User Management | Full user list — approve accounts, ban users |
| Customize Website | Banner editor with modal form, theme settings |

**Post Management (Feature D):**
- Shows all seller products across the platform with seller name, price, category
- Filter pills: All / Pending / Approved / Rejected / Under Review
- Search by product name or seller
- Stats cards: Total / Pending / Approved / Rejected counts
- **Approve** — sets product to `"approved"`, immediately visible in seller shops
- **Reject** — opens a modal requiring an admin comment; comment stored on the product and shown to seller
- **Under Review** — intermediate state for products needing more scrutiny
- Rejection comment displayed as italic red text below the product name

**Seller Management (Feature E):**
- Two tabs: **Sellers** and **Payout Requests**
- Alert banners for pending profile changes and pending payout requests
- Account status actions: Suspend ↔ Activate, Ban ↔ Unban
- **Seller Detail Modal** — all profile fields, account status history
- **Pending profile changes panel** — shows changed fields with old vs. new values; Approve/Reject buttons; approving merges changes and reactivates the seller; rejecting discards and reactivates
- **Payout Requests accordion** — expandable per request; approve or reject with optional admin note

**Order Management (Feature G):**
- Reads **all orders** across all sellers (no seller filter)
- **Unreviewed count** banner at the top — shows number of orders with new updates
- **"New" badge** on rows where `adminReviewed === false`
- Opening an order detail calls `markOrderAdminReviewed()` — clears the badge
- Tracking number displayed prominently in the table and detail modal
- Handover proof link in the detail modal
- **Modular tracking notification block** — currently shows instruction "Check courier's website and notify customer manually"; the `sendTrackingNotification()` function in `seller-store.ts` is designed to be replaced with an AI agent call without changing callers

**Customer Management (Feature F):**
- Reads all customer accounts from the static users array, merging any `ammoo-user-overrides`
- Stats cards: Total Customers, Verified, Active, Flagged
- Customer list table with search
- **Customer Detail Modal** — profile, expandable order history per customer, activity count

---

### 5.13 Notification System

**File:** `src/ui/components/notifications/notification-provider.tsx`

- Toast notifications for user feedback
- 4 severity types: **Success**, **Error**, **Warning**, **Info**
- Auto-dismiss after 5 seconds
- Max 5 simultaneous toasts, position top-right
- Used throughout — signin, register, add to cart, checkout, forms

**Buyer Order Notifications (separate system):**
- Written to `localStorage` (`ammoo-buyer-notifications`) on every OMS status change
- Accessible from the seller's Orders tab bell icon panel
- Readable in buyer profile order timeline

**Tracking Notifications (modular stub):**
- `sendTrackingNotification(orderId, trackingNumber, buyerEmail)` in `seller-store.ts`
- Currently writes a record to `ammoo-tracking-notifications`
- Function is designed for easy replacement with an AI agent or email API — replace only the function body; all callers remain unchanged

