## 8. State Management & Persistence

All runtime state uses **React Context API** — no Redux, no Zustand.

### AuthContext

```
Provider: src/ui/components/auth/auth-context.tsx
Hook:     useAuth()
```

| State | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `user` | `User \| null` | Currently logged-in user (merged with localStorage overrides) |
| `isAuthenticated` | `boolean` | Derived from user != null |
| `isLoading` | `boolean` | True during localStorage hydration |

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `login(email, password)` | Validates credentials, merges `ammoo-user-overrides`, sets user, saves to localStorage |
| `logout()` | Clears user and localStorage; callers redirect to `/` |
| `updateUser(partial)` | Merges partial update into live session; persists to `ammoo-user-overrides`; survives page reload |

### CartContext

```
Provider: src/ui/components/cart/cart-context.tsx
Hook:     useCart()
```

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `addToCart(product, qty, size, color)` | Appends or increments item |
| `removeFromCart(id)` | Removes item by cart item id |
| `updateQuantity(id, qty)` | Updates quantity |
| `clearCart()` | Empties entire cart |
| `getCartItemCount()` | Returns total item count |
| `getCartTotal()` | Returns full subtotal (all items) |

### NotificationContext

```
Provider: src/ui/components/notifications/notification-provider.tsx
Hook:     useNotifications()
```

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `showSuccess(message, title?)` | Green success toast |
| `showError(message, title?)` | Red error toast |
| `showWarning(message, title?)` | Yellow warning toast |
| `showInfo(message, title?)` | Blue info toast |

### localStorage Keys

| Key | Contents |
|-----|---------|
| `userId` | ID string of logged-in user |
| `ammoo-cart` | JSON array of cart items |
| `ammoo-seller-orders` | JSON array of all seller orders (all sellers) |
| `ammoo-seller-products` | JSON array of all seller products (with `approvalStatus`) |
| `ammoo-seller-profiles` | JSON object keyed by sellerId — full seller profile |
| `ammoo-seller-status` | JSON object keyed by sellerId — `SellerAccountStatus` |
| `ammoo-payout-requests` | JSON array of `PayoutRequest` objects |
| `ammoo-user-overrides` | JSON object keyed by userId — profile field overrides |
| `ammoo-bank-details-{sellerId}` | Bank details object per seller |
| `ammoo-transactions-{sellerId}` | Payout transaction array per seller |
| `ammoo-buyer-notifications` | Array of buyer notification objects |
| `ammoo-tracking-notifications` | Array of modular tracking notification records |
| `ammoo-shop-wizard` | Shop wizard draft (step + all non-File form fields) |

### sessionStorage Keys

| Key | Contents |
|-----|---------|
| `ammoo-checkout-selected` | JSON array of selected cart item IDs (set at cart, read at checkout, deleted after order) |

